cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ERBGA, please cite it as below."
title: "ERBGA: Efficient Reduced-Bias Genetic Algorithm for Generic Community Detection Objectives"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aditya
    family-names: Karnam
repository-code: "https://github.com/adityak74/ERBGA"
abstract: >-
  A genetic algorithm for community detection that encodes a partition as a
  set of cut edges, so every community it returns is connected, and that
  optimises any objective function (modularity, Qs, or user-defined).
keywords:
  - community detection
  - genetic algorithm
  - modularity
  - graph clustering
  - network science
version: 1.0.0.dev0
date-released: "2026-10-26"
